From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:46:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Moved KEV and EPSS badges beside the CVSS score in the
 report findings table

After the title they made long titles hard to read. They now share the CVSS
cell, which is wider on desktop, and wrap badge by badge; in the narrower card
layouts they sit on the line under the title with the score. On the narrowest
screens the owner moves up beside the status so the badges have the line to
themselves. Ransomware use is now a badge of its own, so the badges stay short.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JeRCvM2shAtegxe489Vfvx
